---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms governing your use of LogMyFlight and its website.">
  <article class="legal-page container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms of use</p><h1>Clear terms for clear skies.</h1>
    <p class="notice"><strong>Starter document:</strong> Replace the legal identity and effective date, remove TODO text, and obtain appropriate legal review before publication.</p>
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> {site.privacyEffectiveDate}</p>
    <p>These terms govern your use of LogMyFlight and this website. By using the app, you agree to these terms.</p>
    <h2>Using LogMyFlight</h2>
    <p>You may use LogMyFlight for personal, lawful flight recordkeeping. You are responsible for the accuracy and completeness of information you enter and for maintaining appropriate access to your Apple account and devices.</p>
    <h2>A recordkeeping aid</h2>
    <p>LogMyFlight is a recordkeeping aid, not an aviation authority, safety system, or substitute for official documentation and professional judgment. You remain responsible for checking your records and complying with all laws, licensing conditions, operator procedures, and regulatory requirements that apply to you.</p>
    <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
    <p>We aim to keep LogMyFlight reliable, but we do not promise uninterrupted availability or compatibility with every device or operating-system version. Features may change as the app evolves.</p>
    <h2>Your content</h2>
    <p>You retain ownership of flight details, notes, and photos you add. You are responsible for ensuring you have the right to store any content you select.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The LogMyFlight app, website, branding, and original materials are owned by {site.developerName} or their licensors. These terms do not transfer ownership of them to you.</p>
    <h2>Disclaimer and limitation</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the app and website are provided “as is” without warranties, and we are not liable for indirect or consequential loss arising from their use. Nothing in these terms excludes rights or liabilities that cannot legally be excluded.</p>
    <h2>Apple terms</h2>
    <p>Your download and use of the app are also subject to the applicable App Store and Apple media-services terms. TODO: Confirm whether Apple’s standard licensed application end-user licence agreement or a custom EULA will apply.</p>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may revise these terms as the app changes. Questions can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

